 ### 8.1 The scale multiplier
 
 ```
-#tasks  =  |seeds|  ×  |difficulty cells|  ×  |dimensions|  ×  |surface templates|
+#tasks  =  |seeds|  ×  |difficulty cells|  ×  |dimensions|
